window.products.push({"id":300130,"name":"MUUEGM Queen Size Mattress,10 Inch Cooling Gel Green Tea Memory Foam Mattress,Pressure Relief,Medium Feeling,Queen Mattress in a Box,CertiPUR-US Certi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZzmQhZGHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【IMPROVES SLEEP QUALITY】– Our mattress features in adaptable AeroFusion Green Tea gel-infused memory foam designs to keep sleepers stay cool and comfortable. The memory foam helps absorb heat and carries it away from the body to regulate temperature, improving your sleep comfort level and deep sleep,also works to keep the surface of the mattress temperature-neutral and even cool. 【BUILT FOR COMFORT】– This bed mattress is designed for back sleepers, side sleepers and stomach sleepers. The medium-firm feel helps them relieve back stiffness, pain and discomfort, while relaxing their muscles.Our bed mattress features a layered memory foam design that provides complete support for your body and pressure relieving. The bottom layer of our mattresses is a supportive Flex Support Foam Base, ensure long-lasting durability and stability. 【SKIN-FRIENDLY MATTRESS】– You can sleep on this mattress full with confidence, because all our beddings are CertiPUR-US certified to ensure performance and safety. With the Fiberglass-Free FR inner cover and Graphene Fabric cover provide you a healthy and naturally skin-friendly sleep surface, making it a top choice for upscale home mattress. The elegant gel memory foam full mattress is a great gift for children, parent, or friends. 【EASY TO INSTALL AND USE】– The memory foam mattresses are shipped in USA and packaged in a box for ready-to-ship and easy-to-setup. Simply unbox and unroll the mattress, expanding to its original shape within 24~48hours. It is suitable for any solid surface, such as a wood foundation, box spring, slats, the floor or an adjustable base and its cover can be easily unzipped and removed for easy spot cleaning. 【QUALITY WARRANTY】– Every mattress purchase is covered under our 10-Year Limited Warranty. We believe that you will love your sleep item and are dedicated to giving you the best night of sleep through our superior products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZzmQhZGHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUUEGM","source_asin":"B0C5CY1YZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-300130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5CY1YZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5CY1YZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
