window.products.push({"id":300277,"name":"Unicorn Advent Calendar 2022 for Kids: Super Value Unicorn Accessories Including Makeup Kits,Hair Accessories,Jewelry Making Kit,Unicorn Gifts for Gir","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T03YSAtML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Best Gift for Unicorn Obsessed] The magic of childhood and the magic of unicorns go hand in hand. This 2022 newest unicorn advent calendar will have everyone believing in unicorns and dreaming about rainbows and glitter! We've picked out the best of the bunch. There are gifts for younger kids as well as older kids and tweens in the gift box. It's never too early or too late to encourage imagination with these great unicorn gifts. [Real Makeup Kits] Have you ever dreamed of owning a cosmetic set when you were a little girl? Our perfect makeup kits are designed for a little princess with vibrant tones and superb texture which contains 2 soft brushes,6 colors - glittery eye shadows, shimmery lip glosses and lipstick. Nothing better than spending time with your best friends and turning into a princess for a unicorn-theme Christmas party or cosplay makeup. [Dreamy Hair Accessories] If you know a child who is a unicorn lover, get them these unicorn accessories set so they can show the world that they believe in magic. With a giant gradually color-changing bow and the unicorn braids to match, your child can dress up as the sweetest rainbow unicorn princess in the world. They will also find all the beautiful hair clips behind the windows. There’s plenty of glitter and iridescence to be had so that there will never be a lack of sparkle on your child’s hair! [Sparkly Unicorn Jewelries] What unicorn advent calendar would be complete without some sparkly and colorful jewelry? For children without pierced ears, this earring set gives them options to celebrate their love of unicorns. A young style icon can go all the way with these glittery cute rings. These designs are colorful and fun enough for holidays or for other special occasions. [Craft Your Own Magic] Kids can proudly display both their craft skills and love of unicorns with this set. It comes with beads of different shapes and bungee strings. Children can just add some extra sparkle with an accessory or two. Whether they used to mark their page in a storybook or to keep their diary on the right week, these unicorn bookmarks make adorable gifts for them. And kids can cheer up their paper crafts with the unicorn stickers and rhinestones. [Festive Gift Box Packing] Prepare for jump-up-and-down excitement and little girl squeals when you send this unicorn gift to your special little princess at any time of the year. The exquisite present box and design are perfect for Christmas stocking stuffers, and birthday party favors. Not just for Christmas celebrations but for daily life surprises.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T03YSAtML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gadarleia","source_asin":"B0B6BSTNT7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-300277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6BSTNT7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6BSTNT7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
