window.products.push({"id":300362,"name":"SUPERIOR Traditional Oriental Medallion Non-Slip Indoor Washable Area Rug, 2' x 3', Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xr4R7AwJL._AC_.jpg","description":"Affordable Luxury Linens Introducing Superior’s Eldwin—a screen-printed nylon area rug of first-rate quality. The Eldwin displays a traditional Persian design with a modern penumbra finish. A vivid diamond medallion is cast over a soft cream backdrop, creating an artistic shadow effect. Each Eldwin rug was designed to attract attention to your home or office space with a striking look. Each rug is expertly crafted with the highest quality 100% Nylon fibers and dyes, is tufted to be soft to the touch, and durable enough to withstand even the highest traffic areas of the home. Bring an effortlessly chic look and feel into your dorm room, home office, or bedroom at an outstanding value.  With over 200 designs, Superior offers a wide range of prints and sizes to maximize any space in your home no matter your preference. Our incredible selections are guaranteed to impress family and friends. Vacuum regularly to maintain the quality and durability of this beautiful fabric. Machine washable, delicate cycle, cold, neutral detergent and lay flat to dry. Do not bleach. Hand washable can be lightly hosed or brushed as well. Also, air-dry the rug to prolong the life of the backing. Dry outdoors away from direct sunlight or on a clean, flat surface, flipping it frequently to dry quickly and evenly. Use, wash and repeat. Heritage We have been manufacturing fine linens for over 40 years. We make everything from towels and bathrobes, to comforters and mattress toppers, sheets, duvets, pillowcases, and bed skirts, and even area rugs. Our wide range of colors, patterns, and price points ensures that every one of our customers will be able to find something they'll love. We are experts in manufacturing high-quality textiles and pride ourselves on only producing the most beautiful products for our customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xr4R7AwJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B07DGR752S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-300362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DGR752S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DGR752S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
