window.products.push({"id":300364,"name":"Mini Fine Mesh Strainer, Fine Mesh Sieve Baking Sifter Sieve Stainless steel Tea Strainers for Loose Tea, Coffee, Oil, Quinoa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611nUDlYDZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You will get a mini sieve fine mesh that is 3.4 inches in diameter. extra fine mesh sieve can filter as small food as possible. Material: The extra fine mesh strainer is made of food grade 304 (18/8) stainless steel, it’s rust proof and durable. The strainer mesh is also made of this material, which is soft and tough. Sift, Strain And Rinse: Hand strainer works great for sifting, straining and rinsing large quantities of wet or dry ingredients. Practical Design: The wide stainless-steel brim and loop make it easy for the coffee strainer to rest on almost any bowl or pot, and rivet fixed makes it extra sturdy. Hollow Handle: The hollow handle of the food strainers has good grip, anti-skid and heat resistance, which is ergonomic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611nUDlYDZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yokudo","source_asin":"B08TVTFM9G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-300364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TVTFM9G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TVTFM9G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
