window.products.push({"id":300367,"name":"E T Multi Color Rubber Backing, 1 gal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.12,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hybkadOQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP RUGS WHERE THEY BELONG! Our Fiber-Lok non-skid rug backing can be applied to new and old rugs with ease. Simply brush the backside of your rug or mat with a thin, even coat and our Fiber-Lok technology will do the rest. The backing will appear transparent when it is dry and ready to re-coat (two thin coats are better than one heavy application). Ideal for latch hook rugs, punch rugs, wall hangings, placemats, or table runners. Keep rugs in place and avoid accidents! It's a common problem in many households to have slippery floors. Mats or carpets won't stay in place and walking with slippers around unstable or slippery surfaces can be dangerous, making you prone to accidents. Thankfully, Environment Technology Inc. formulated its Fiber-Lok Non-skid Rug Backing to give you and your family safety and peace of mind. Designed to withstand curling and sliding, keeping the rugs in place and flat forever. This area gripper can be widely used with all types of floor such as hardwood, concrete or tiles. And it's durable too! Wash it or dry it, the Fiber-Lok Non-skid Rug Backing stays in place all day long. This durable anti-slip formula will keep carpets exactly where you want them! Fiber-Lok's non-slip backing also doesn't leave any stains or residue, which means you won't have to worry about ruining your floors, slides or surfaces when you apply this product around the home. Avoid accidents now and grab a tub of Fiber-Lok Non-skid Backing today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hybkadOQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E T","source_asin":"B010SXR0OM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-300367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010SXR0OM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010SXR0OM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
