window.products.push({"id":300531,"name":"Red Poppy ~ Elegant India Floral Print Luxury Queen Bedspread 90x90","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wCkCHJ91L._AC_.jpg","description":"Like instant coffee our colorful exotic 100% cotton luxury queen bedspread coverlets will provide an immediate pick-me-up for your rooms. Let your creativity use these to effect, either as throws, tapestries or as a light coverlet to stay cool under, during the hot summer months.   The Queen bedspread is 90 inches wide and 90 inches long and is printed on preshrunk, superior grade, soft cotton and is exquisitely finished with neat double stitched hems  Each piece is handcrafted using intricately hand carved wooden blocks and is an original work of art distinguished by the work of the artisan, the particular lot of dye, and even varying weather conditions. Tonal variations are inherent to the block printing process and enhance the individuality, character and uniqueness of each creation. About Red Poppy: The Red Poppy stands diminutive yet bold with its papery red blooms in full display. The mughal inspired poppy motifs rest on a rich golden honey tan ground that is textured ever so slightly with a delicate floral architectural \"jaal\" (latticework). The jaal, which is characteristic of Indo-Islamic architecture, provides subtle ornamentation while accentuating and integrating the overall design. The simple classic elegance and relatively neutral palette of the Red Poppy render it a design for all seasons and effortlessly versatile in its application.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wCkCHJ91L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saffron Marigold","source_asin":"B001AHJH9W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-300531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001AHJH9W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001AHJH9W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":300532,"name":"Frost Buddy Universal Wine Buddy (Maroon Glitter) - Vacuum Insulated Wine Bottle Cooler & Holder - Double Walled Stainless Steel Wine Chiller - Enjoy ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711-xo6-JfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝐊𝐄𝐄𝐏 𝐃𝐑𝐈𝐍𝐊𝐒 𝐈𝐂𝐄 𝐂𝐎𝐋𝐃: This wine bottle chiller will keep wine cold for hours, so you can take it with you and drink it later. Wine, champagne, and other drinks can remain cold for 12+ hours with no need for an ice bucket. 𝐏𝐎𝐑𝐓𝐀𝐁𝐋𝐄, 𝐒𝐄𝐀𝐌𝐋𝐄𝐒𝐒 𝐃𝐄𝐒𝐈𝐆𝐍: This portable wine chiller is travel-friendly, so you can bring any bottle size anywhere. It's easy to carry, and will fit nearly all 750ml wine bottles. The air-tight seal and no-sweat exterior enhance the function of the product, making it superior to similar items and accessories. 𝐍𝐎𝐍-𝐒𝐋𝐈𝐏 𝐑𝐔𝐁𝐁𝐄𝐑 𝐁𝐎𝐓𝐓𝐎𝐌: This upright wine chiller is engineered to optimize balance and friction, so you can set it on any flat surface and will stand in place. Made with high-quality materials, for durability and to resist spills. 𝐄𝐅𝐅𝐄𝐂𝐓𝐈𝐕𝐄 𝐈𝐍𝐒𝐔𝐋𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍 𝐓𝐄𝐂𝐇𝐍𝐎𝐋𝐎𝐆𝐘: This stainless steel wine insulator is double-walled and vacuum-insulated to make sure the temperature inside the container stays put. More effective than a simple sleeve. Very low heat conductivity means that your drink will remain cold, even in a hot environment! 𝐔𝐒𝐄 𝐈𝐓 𝐀𝐍𝐘 𝐓𝐈𝐌𝐄, 𝐀𝐍𝐘 𝐏𝐋𝐀𝐂𝐄: Not just for wine chilling! Can be used as a water bottle insulator, and also works with sports drinks, soft drinks, or anything else that will fit inside it. Take your beverage with you at your home, office, or car. Bring it to outdoor events, hiking, the beach, camping, bbq, and more! 𝐏𝐑𝐄𝐌𝐈𝐔𝐌 𝐐𝐔𝐀𝐋𝐈𝐓𝐘 𝐖𝐈𝐍𝐄 𝐂𝐇𝐈𝐋𝐋𝐄𝐑: We take pride on making our customers our top priority. Our buddies are first no matter what, so reach out if you need to exchange, return, ask a question, talk to a friend, or anything else we can help with! Each buddy comes with a 1 year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711-xo6-JfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Frost Buddy","source_asin":"B09BZSRGZX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-300532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BZSRGZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BZSRGZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
