window.products.push({"id":300535,"name":"Decorative Plate 8 cm Old Irish Blessing Hanging Decorative Plate May the Road Rise to meet you.. by Royal Tara","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91V0CE5qrdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The beautiful old Irish Blessing plate, covered at every inch by breathtaking Irish artwork, astonishingly intricate detailing and shimmering greens, blues, and yellows, is as magnificent in its physical beauty as the elegantly scrawled Old Irish blessing on its center is in its emotional beauty. The blessing, reading “May the road rise to meet you, may the wind be always at your back, may the sun shine warm upon your face and the rain fall soft upon your fields, and until we meet again, may God hold you in the hollow of his hand,” lights up a room with feelings of joy and calm through its wishes of prosperity. The overall look of the Irish Blessing plate, from the handwriting of said prayer to the graceful Irish birds and Celtic knots adorning the rim of the plate, was inspired by ancient Celtic manuscripts that were painted by monks onto parchment or calf skin centuries ago. The product includes an easel and hook for hanging to allow for a painless and fast installation. This plate measures 8” in diameter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91V0CE5qrdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Tara","source_asin":"B00PFUIPMA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-300535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PFUIPMA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PFUIPMA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":300536,"name":"13.5\" Original Danish Dough Whisk/ Dutch Whisk and Baker‘s Bench/Counter Brush-Bakers Bread Kit Bundle-Hand Mixer/Blender for Cake Bread Pizza and Pas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nfErsK-RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In case you don’t know, bread baking is one of the hottest trend at the moment! Google even says so itself since trend shows spike in “bread” searches this quarantine season. Whether you’re an advance or professional baker who is ready to bring out that sourdough pan or a starter / newbie still learning to bake a banana bread, you can’t deny that bread making is in its glory days. But whatever recipe it is you’re planning to do, whatever level you are in as a baker, you will always need some basic kitchen baking tools. This whisk is a solution to every kitchen that lacks a stand mixer. If you’ve been baking for some time, you know that using a balloon whisk to mix any kind of dough is hard – hard for both the mixing and the cleaning! But this whisk is engineered to cut through dough without over-mixing or getting stuck. It ensures gets to scrape the sides of the bowl and ensures that all flour is fully incorporated – and we all know this is an important step when baking. It’s handy for other types of batter and baking projects such as cookies, no knead bread, brownies, muffins, cakes. It also works for handle with care batters like crepes and pancakes that shouldn’t be overmixed. With these tools – your French bread proofing will be easy. And since we want the best help for you in the kitchen, this bundle comes with a natural baker’s brush for your baking and pastry cooking. It is naturally made and no environmentally harmful substances where used. The perfect bakery brush is hard to find and here we are, offering you every baker’s dream bundle! This is a high quality brush made of 100% natural materials. Use it to sweep excess flour from your kitchen counter, your dough, pasta cutters and everything you used during your baking session. Taking baking classes? Purchase this set and impress your proctor, professor, and classmates with these!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nfErsK-RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PlaaDesign","source_asin":"B08KVSM7TN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-300536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KVSM7TN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KVSM7TN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":300537,"name":"Magimix Toaster Vision Black 1450 Watt Toaster","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eDhhDrB8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Magimix Vision Toaster is the world’s first see-through toaster. Finally, toast just as you like it with the visual control. The long-life quartz elements give consistent browning, and the double insulated glass windows are easy to clean. The Vision Toaster also includes single button features such as a bagel function for single sided toasting, reheat function to reheat already-toasted bread without drying it out, and a defrost function to simultaneously defrost and toast bread. Visual Control: for toast just the way you like it Simple to use: 1 button = 1 function Baguette Button: One side toasting Reheat Button: to reheat previously toasted bread without drying it out Defrost Button: to toast frozen bread Accurate Control: 8 browning levels Commercial Heating Elements: can be replaced Extra wide slot (1.5”): for toasting most types of bread Extra-lift lever: to safely remove smaller pieces of toast Automatic Self Centering: for even browning Bread Ejection: automatic Crumb Tray: large capacity Cleaning: window safe opening Power: 1450 W Materials: Stainless steel, aluminum sides, glass Guarantee: 3 years Dimensions: H 8.9” x W 15.6” x D 7” Weight: 9.5 lb","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eDhhDrB8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magimix","source_asin":"B07DM6WM78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-300537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DM6WM78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DM6WM78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
