window.products.push({"id":300591,"name":"Homcomoda Absorbent Ceramic Coasters for Cold Drinks Set of 4 Ocean Life Cork Back Stone Coasters for Coffee Mugs Cups(Octopus, Set of 4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xG8nXsh-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CERAMIC COASTER SIZE: This ceramic coaster measures 4\"(10cm) in diameter and 0.3” (0.7cm) in height, almost suitable for many types of glasses: highball, lowball, bourbon whisky, scotch glass. Package: Set of 4 coasters. (About the size, please allow 1-2cm differs because of manual measurement; About the color, please allow a little color difference due to the shooting light and angle.) SUPERB ABSORBENCY KEEP YOUR TABLE DRY: Our stone coasters adopt special absorptive material. Compared to paper coasters, these absorbent coasters NEVER stick to the bottom of your bottles or glasses then fall back onto you when you pick up your drink . You and your families or friends can enjoy party without worrying about excess condensation from cold beverages, Whiskey, Cocktail, beer, etc. SOFT CORKING: The cork on the bottom side keeps the coaster very sturdy and doesn't slide around the table. The cork backing provides extra grip and protect any delicate countertop like Walnut, Granite, Bamboo, Oak, Marble, Pine wood. EASY TO CARE: The “drink” spills coaters are incredible dirty-resistant. If you aren’t careful to spill beer, beverage or oil on the stone coaters, you just need a piece of paper to wipe the stain away. Very convenient to clean these round coasters, just rinse it by water. (Warm note: Color stains may be hard to wash out.) EXCELLENT DECOR & PERFECT GIFT: They're solid ceramic/stone material with really good designs and colors. The paint is not coming off with use. It's not a sticker. Its a design printed onto the stone, so it does absorb the liquid that drips off of glasses. The coasters colors have the most vibrant colors. They are absolutely exquisite. It's like little pieces of artwork. Perfect for home, office, bar, coffee shop and all occasions. Worthy for a outstanding gift for housewarming, birthday or","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xG8nXsh-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homcomoda","source_asin":"B07CB7VS88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-300591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CB7VS88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CB7VS88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
