window.products.push({"id":300608,"name":"Aoneiric 100% Blackout Thermal Insulated Blinds for Windows, UV Protection Striped Fabric Roller Shades for Windows, Roller Blind for Office and Home.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Wa-HaA1ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Aoneiric Blackout Roller shade】Blind size: 36\" width x 72\" height. Blocking 100% light and 95% UV ray, energy saving insulates against heat and cold, noise is reduced and provide privacy, premium fabric good for bedroom, kithchen and bathroom. 【LIGHT-BLOCKING, HEAT INSULATION, AND COMFORT】Roller shade for home is perfect for creating a warm and cozy space that's open and chic, shielding you from the sun in complete style. The thermal white backing balances the temperature, maintains the indoor temperature during the summer, and keeps warm in winter. Elegant fabric is good for bedroom, kithchen, bathroom, office room, hotel , and so on. 【INSIDE MOUNT SIZE】Subtract 1/2\" from the window width and that's the roller blind width size you need. (The roller blind size you choose refers to the width of the accessories plus fabric. If you order a 35\" wide size, the shade fabric width is 34\".) You can adjust the height of the shade with the corded from 0\" to 72\" in length. Note: Tiny light gap will exist on each side by the inside mounting. Want 100% blackout, pls choose the outside mount. 【OUTSIDE MOUNT SIZE】Window width Plus 4 inches is shade width( shade width= window width+4\"); All blinds sizes are based on the blind TOP header width. There is about a 1.5-inch gap between the fabric and valance to allow for the top mechanism. 【TIPS】Aoneiric window roller shade contains an accessory kit including clutch, brackets, screws, safety device, and installation manual for convenience. Clean shade with a dry cloth, ironing at low temperature. The new item maybe has subtle wrinkles, but they will disappear in several days. 【SAFETY DESIGN】 To ensure the safety of your family, we provide a safety device to connect the chain to the wall and all the relevant safety instructions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Wa-HaA1ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aoneiric","source_asin":"B09X43555V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-300608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X43555V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X43555V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
