window.products.push({"id":300628,"name":"[Front Door WREATH HANGER] - Antler Design | ADJUSTABLE Hook Length for Tall and Small Doors | PADDING to Prevent Damage like Scratch and Dents | Heav","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qh7T-InqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hanging a wreath on your front door gives your home a welcoming entrance that leaves your visitors stunned. Damaging your door with nails leaves a terrible view when no wreath is hung, and the adhesive hangers simply don't hold. As you know, the low quality alternatives are an eyesore that take attention away from your beautiful wreath, but with our decorative wreath hangers the beauty is only complemented and enhanced. The Adjustable wreath hanger allows you to perfectly place your wreath at the ideal height on your door. Holding wreaths up to 20lbs., this durable wrought iron wreath hanger can display your wreath anywhere from 11\" - 18\" from the top of the door. Available in a variety of designs, the Antler design is always a favorite","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qh7T-InqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VILLAGE LIGHTING COMPANY","source_asin":"B07T9P9ZGF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-300628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T9P9ZGF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T9P9ZGF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":300629,"name":"Pillow Perfect Flowering Branch Throw Pillow, 16.5-inch, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kUgy-CSzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As cheery as a spring day, this floral-printed floor pillow beautifully embellishes any room and makes an elegant addition to a nature lover's space. Set on a beige background, the vibrant red cherry blossoms with touches of light pink are delicately balanced on each branch. This pillow easily complements many decors, especially modern or traditional themes.  For more than 30 years, Pillow Perfect has been designing and manufacturing decorative pillows and outdoor furniture cushions for the largest online and brick-and-mortar retailers in the United States. We have always been focused on providing the highest level of quality, service, and style, and our talented in-house creative team is constantly watching design and color trends, ensuring that we are always ahead of the curve. Founded by current CEO/Owner Paul and his brother David in 1989, Pillow Perfect products have always been proudly made in the USA, and our Woodstock, GA facility is truly where the magic happens. Each pillow is cut, sewn, labeled, filled, and finished by our team of dedicated employees so you can enjoy it on your sofa, chaise lounge, or in your personal backyard oasis.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kUgy-CSzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pillow Perfect","source_asin":"B01A0GPSUK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-300629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A0GPSUK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A0GPSUK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
